      "content": "Can you be more specific about that \"novel architecture\"? I need a much more detailed breakdown of the technical differentiators so I can present it to the client as a formal novelty argument. Look closely at the existing thermal battery patents in the database—did you skip over anything that might look similar to our flow specs?",
